        "Id": "d6de2a2c-50e5-4708-9f15-6d33db94a05a",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Gama Hospital Drug Peddling Scheme",
        "Location": "LOCATION_HOKKAIDO",
        "PublicId": "110754595081",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository e0143799-7291-4e70-b761-3f960bf99a42).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\rThe client has asked us to eliminate five targets in the Gama, set in Hokkaido, Japan. You must dispose of any camera evidence. Your targets: Maverick, a merc using his security position to cover up the drug scheme. Nails is the one responsible for transportation of such substances. Olsen is responsible for testing the drugs on unknowing patients. Ito disposes of unsuccessful patients&apos; bodies. Finally there&apos;s Tawara, the one taking stock of supply.\rHappy hunting, 47.",
